{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-55908","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64224","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-55909","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64225","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-64226","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-64227","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-64228","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-64229","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-64230","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-55910","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64231","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55911","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64232","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-55912","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64233","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-64234","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-64235","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-55913","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64236","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-64237","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-55914","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64238","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-64239","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-64240","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-55915","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-55916","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64241","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-55917","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64242","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55918","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64243","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-55919","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-55920","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64244","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55921","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64245","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-55922","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64246","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-64247","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-64248","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-55923","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-55924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64249","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-55925","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64250","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-55926","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-64251","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55927","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64252","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-64253","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-64254","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-64255","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-64256","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-55928","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64257","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-64258","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-55929","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55932","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64259","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-55931","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55934","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64260","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-64261","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64262","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-55933","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55936","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64263","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-64264","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64265","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-55935","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55938","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64266","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-64267","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64268","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-55937","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55940","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64269","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-64270","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64271","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-55939","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55942","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64272","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-64273","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64274","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-55941","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55944","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64275","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-64276","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-64277","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-55943","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55946","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64278","marks":["code"],"text":"check_prerequisite/3"},{"id":"spn-64279","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-64280","marks":["code"],"text":"{:allow, state}"},{"id":"spn-64281","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-64282","marks":["code"],"text":"{:block, reason, state}"}]}],"id":"blk-55945","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55948","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64283","text":"Tracks violations as audit entries"}]}],"id":"blk-55947","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55950","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64284","text":"Wraps MCP tool dispatch — called before every tool invocation"}]}],"id":"blk-55949","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-55951","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64285","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-64286","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement the two enforced pipelines"},{"id":"spn-64287","text":" (section 3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55952","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55954","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64288","text":"Reactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-64289","marks":["code"],"text":"query |> recall |> topology |> deliberate(if κ>0) |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-55953","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55956","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64290","text":"Proactive pipeline: "},{"id":"spn-64291","marks":["code"],"text":"heartbeat |> survey |> triage |> dispatch |> store"}]}],"id":"blk-55955","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64292","text":"Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3) — 10 routing rules"}]}],"id":"blk-55957","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-55959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64293","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-64294","marks":["bold"],"text":"Integration with OS-006"},{"id":"spn-64295","text":" (section 5.3)"}]},{"id":"blk-55960","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55962","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-64296","text":"OS-008 PipelineEnforcer runs BEFORE OS-006 PermissionEngine"}